      "text": "cloud overshadowed them: and behold a voice out of the cloud, Matt. 17:5 (Mark 9:7; Luke 9:34). coming in the clouds of heaven, Matt. 24:30 (26:64; Mark 13:26; 14:62; Luke 21:27; D&C 45:44; JS—M 1:36). a cloud received him out of their sight, Acts 1:9. all baptized unto Moses in the cloud, 1 Cor. 10:2. caught up together with them in the clouds, 1 Thes. 4:17. clouds that are carried with a tempest, 2 Pet. 2:17. clouds they are without water, Jude 1:12. he cometh with clouds, Rev. 1:7. they ascended up to heaven in a cloud, Rev. 11:12. upon the cloud one sat like unto the Son of man, Rev. 14:14.",
